# (build 106) The save's recruits and technique counts by name, read back.
#
# routes/saves/save_named_fields.json is paseo_rolf_dead.json (Paseo,
# under Rolf's door) with Rolf alive, the party Rolf, Rudo and Amy, and
# only build 106's names: "last_recruit_joined": "Shir",
# "last_recruit_sent": "Shir away" -- Shir has joined and gone off with a
# theft (ProcessStealItem raises party_member_join_next to 8) -- and Rolf's
# "battle_techniques_known": 5, "map_techniques_known": 3, "knows_musik":
# true (bit 7 of the map count: Musik in the last known place, loc_112FC).
#
# Rolf's house (loc_B04E): the two counters differ and the sent one is 8,
# so "Hey, Shir is coming back!" ($0927); loc_B282 then lowers it to 7 and
# puts Shir last in the party ($0928). Build 105 read neither name: the
# counters stayed at a fresh game's (0 and 1), so Nei's knock ($090C)
# came instead, and Rolf knew no map techniques.

start slot 1 routes/saves/save_named_fields.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c                      # one page fewer than paseo_rolf_dead: three members
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 4 45 18
expect join-next 8
press up                     # into Rolf's house
wait idle
expect script $0927
shot 01_shir_coming_back
press c
wait idle
shot 02_shir_back
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect join-next 7
expect party Rolf Rudo Amy Shir
press c                      # the C menu
wait idle
press down
press down
press c                      # TECH
wait idle
press c                      # Rolf: his three map techniques, Musik last
wait idle
shot 03_rolf_map_techniques
expect no-stderr not ported
